## Data Memory (inside rv32i_top)

```systemverilog
logic [31:0] dmem [0:MEM_DEPTH-1];

// Synchronous byte-enable write — byte enable computed by MEM stage
always_ff @(posedge clk) begin
    if (dmem_we) begin
        if (dmem_byte_en[0]) dmem[dmem_addr[31:2]][7:0]   <= dmem_wdata[7:0];
        if (dmem_byte_en[1]) dmem[dmem_addr[31:2]][15:8]  <= dmem_wdata[15:8];
        if (dmem_byte_en[2]) dmem[dmem_addr[31:2]][23:16] <= dmem_wdata[23:16];
        if (dmem_byte_en[3]) dmem[dmem_addr[31:2]][31:24] <= dmem_wdata[31:24];
    end
end

// Asynchronous read
assign dmem_rdata = dmem[dmem_addr[31:2]];
```

Notes:
- dmem_addr, dmem_wdata, dmem_byte_en, dmem_we, dmem_re are outputs of rv32i_mem_stage
- dmem_rdata is input to rv32i_mem_stage

