## 9. Program Counter Pattern

```systemverilog
always_ff @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin
    if (!rst_n)
        pc <= 32'h00000000;
    else if (!stall)
        pc <= pc_next;
end

// pc_next selection (combinational)
always_comb begin
    if (jump)
        pc_next = jump_target;
    else if (branch_taken)
        pc_next = branch_target;
    else
        pc_next = pc + 32'd4;
end
```

