### Fix
```systemverilog
always_comb begin
    // Safe defaults before case
    reg_write = 1'b0;
    mem_read  = 1'b0;
    mem_write = 1'b0;

    case (opcode)
        7'b0110011: reg_write = 1'b1;
        7'b0000011: mem_read  = 1'b1;
        default: ; // defaults already set above — no action needed
    endcase
end
```

