### Pattern

```systemverilog
initial begin
    // Load from compile-time parameter (synthesis flow)
    if (MEM_FILE != "")
        $readmemh(MEM_FILE, imem);
    // Load from runtime plusarg (simulation flow: +load=filename)
    else begin
        string load_file;
        if ($value$plusargs("load=%s", load_file))
            $readmemh(load_file, imem);
    end
end
```

